<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4075" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθ-εύω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.1.5
				</span></i>
			, al.:—<i>speak truth</i>, 
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				562
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				589c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					202b
				</span></i>
			: with neut. Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πάντα</span>
			<i>speak truth</i> in all things, <i><span class="en">
				Batr.
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.4.15
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς δέκα ἡμέρας
			ἠλήθευσε</span> he <i>rightly foretold . . </i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.6.18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοὺς ἐπαίνους</span>
			<i>prove</i> their praises <i>true</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔνομα</span> `make good',
				<i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.4c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>to be, prove true</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be fulfilled</i>, of conditions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τούτοις -ομένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.6.10
				</span></i>
			, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			 of reasoners, <i>arrive at truth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1062a25
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λόγος -εύεται</span>”
				<i>is in accordance with truth, Top.</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					132b4
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθεύεσθαι κατά τινος</span>
			<i>to be truly predicated of</i> . . , ib.<i><span class="en">
				132a31
			</span></i>, al.: fut.
			
				Med.
			 in same sense, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1100a35
			</span></i>, al.</div>
